<title>SINGAPORE: Aiwa sees sales of 310 bln yen in FY96.</title>
<headline>Aiwa sees sales of 310 bln yen in FY96.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aiwa Co Ltd, a unit of Sony Corp, said on Tuesday it expected to realise consolidated sales of 310 billion yen and a consolidated net profit of 5.4 billion yen for its 1996 fiscal year ended March 31, 1997.  </p>
<p>The unofficial forecast was made by Yoshio Ishigaki, president of Aiwa Co, at a news briefing in Singapore.</p>
<p>For its last fiscal year, Aiwa reported consolidated sales of 297 billion yen and a consolidated net profit of 5.31 billion yen.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
